# Netlify redirects for alfea.io
#
# These two rules only work once reactivate.alfea.io and web-creation.alfea.io
# are added as domain aliases on THIS Netlify site (Site settings > Domain
# management > Add domain alias). Until that's done they're simply unused.
#
# IMPORTANT: this intentionally does NOT touch anything below
# web-creation.alfea.io — closed client preview sites live at
# <slug>.web-creation.alfea.io (see the separate alfea.io prospecting-pipeline
# repo's README). A wildcard rule here would break every one of those.

https://reactivate.alfea.io/*   https://alfea.io/reactivate-leads/   301!
https://web-creation.alfea.io/  https://alfea.io/website-creation/   301!

# Convenience alias so /video-creation also reaches the Julaide product,
# in case that's ever linked from somewhere other than the homepage card.
/video-creation   https://julaide.io   302
